<form class="form evaluator" onsubmit="event.preventDefault()">
  <div class="text">Exam evaluator</div>
  <details class="evaluator-help">
    <summary>How to prepare the folder</summary>
    <p>Select a folder containing one subfolder per student, named <span class="code">NAMESURNAME</span>,
      with the .asm files of the exam (e.g. <span class="code">main.asm</span> and <span class="code">function.asm</span>),
      and a file with the use cases (e.g. <span class="code">tests.txt</span>):</p>
<pre>exams/
  tests.txt
  ROSSIMARIO/main.asm
  ROSSIMARIO/function.asm
  BIANCHILUCIA/main.asm
  ...</pre>
    <p>Each use case has an <span class="code">[input]</span> section (one input per line, as typed in the console)
      and an <span class="code">[output]</span> section (the expected output, verbatim); <span class="code">[case name]</span> is optional:</p>
<pre>[case positive numbers]
[input]
5
3
[output]
The product is 15</pre>
    <p>Outputs are compared line by line ignoring trailing spaces and trailing empty lines.
      The typed inputs are not part of the output.</p>
  </details>
  <div class="evaluator-row">
    <input type="file" id="evaluator-folder-input" webkitdirectory directory multiple style="display:none"
           onchange="evaluatorFolderChanged(this)">
    <button type="button" class="button default" id="evaluator-choose" onclick="evaluatorChooseFolderOnClick()">
      <div class="icon gray-4"><%-Icons.render('files')%></div>
      <div class="label">Choose exams folder...</div>
    </button>
  </div>
  <div class="evaluator-row">
    <label for="evaluator-max-steps">Max steps per run</label>
    <input type="number" id="evaluator-max-steps" min="1" step="1" value="<%=ctx.maxSteps%>">
  </div>
  <div class="evaluator-row">
    <input type="checkbox" id="evaluator-ignore-whitespace">
    <label for="evaluator-ignore-whitespace">Ignore all whitespace differences (spaces and empty lines)</label>
  </div>
  <div id="evaluator-status" class="evaluator-status">No folder selected.</div>
  <div id="evaluator-results" class="evaluator-results"></div>
  <div class="buttons">
    <button type="button" class="button default" onclick="closeEvaluatorOnClick()">
      <div class="label">Close</div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="button default" id="evaluator-download" disabled onclick="evaluatorDownloadOnClick()">
      <div class="icon gray-4"><%-Icons.render('save')%></div>
      <div class="label">Download Excel</div>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="button default" id="evaluator-start" disabled onclick="evaluatorStartOnClick()">
      <div class="icon gray-4"><%-Icons.render('run')%></div>
      <div class="label">Evaluate</div>
    </button>
  </div>
</form>
